title: "navier-stokes-computational-research"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Contreras Fuentes"
    given-names: "Marcos"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1858-1611"
abstract: "Research-oriented Python software for deterministic 2D incompressible Navier-Stokes simulations on periodic domains. The project supports reproducible numerical experiments, pseudo-spectral vorticity-streamfunction simulations, validation reports, Taylor-Green 2D validation, convergence-study artifacts, diagnostic metrics and local static HTML reports. This software is a computational research baseline and does not claim to solve the 3D Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize problem."
keywords:
  - Navier-Stokes
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - numerical methods
  - scientific computing
  - reproducibility
  - Taylor-Green vortex
  - Python
license: "MIT"
